            },
            {
              "file": "smoke/jamaica/desktop-open.png",
              "observations": "Broad plain teal underside, pale inner walls and green rim are exposed. Rear hinge gap, prominent upper clasp tab and stepped pale rim corners merit construction review; no unmistakable large missing face is visible."
            },
            {
              "file": "smoke/jamaica/mobile-closed.png",
              "observations": "Full mountain and feet fit. Title leaves Crow alone on a second line. Small terrain clusters and layered clasp lose definition; lid seam and front-left corner are visually busy."
